[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最近经常出现既视感。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"梦见后，然后变成现实。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我本以为是预知梦。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但却不是。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我认为是梦的情景其实是现实……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只有心灵回到了过去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当强烈希望能重新来过时，就会回到过去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那不是预知梦。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但我因此而得到了救赎。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为……能让那些不悦的事重新来过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"十分的便利。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以我也告诉了爸爸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"告诉他，今天会下雨。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"天气预报都不曾报道的预报。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"爸爸听到后先是吃惊，然后露出了不愉快的表情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随后说了一句“不会下的”就出了门，没有带伞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他不肯相信我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"晚上，被雨淋湿的爸爸回到了家里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还感冒了。"},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i743"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1441"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":512},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"绘图日记上画着白羽和羽未张大着嘴的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在吃什么东西吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15415"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唱歌。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……喔喔，是在唱歌啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天似乎是想和妈妈唱歌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有什么想唱的歌吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……唔。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"陷入了思考。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还没定下来唱什么歌是吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15340"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“（点头）”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那至少想知道是什么类型的歌呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……唔。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"害她陷入了烦恼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这下怎么办呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……啊，有了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然想起来，我应该带了一台MD播放器来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然来岛上后完全没用过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"让她听听上面的歌，说不定就能知道她喜欢的类型了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你等我一下。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15560"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i68"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回到房间拿出了播放器。"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这是……什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“MD播放器啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15468"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“MD……播放器……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你不知道吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15378"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“第一次见……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔，这玩意应该没这么罕见吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“总之你先听听看，然后告诉我喜欢哪一首。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i249"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15373"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将一边耳机放进羽未的耳朵。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"另一边放进自己的耳朵。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后按下了播放键。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15345"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……哇!؟”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15328"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好吵。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对不起，音量有些大了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而且还是重金属的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15428"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“害怕……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"吓到她了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之她看起来并不喜欢这首歌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那下一首。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将带来的所有MD重头放一遍。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15468"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过羽未比起音乐本身，倒是对MD播放器更感兴趣。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不行吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15479"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯……好老……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“老？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然是有些老歌，不过更多的是最近的新歌吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我想要能和妈妈一起唱的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦哦，要家喻户晓的那种是吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"话虽如此，但仔细一想却又没有头绪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我没那种歌的MD呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不……等等……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说到歌，昨天在泳池有个女生唱了儿歌来着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，我们去灯塔。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14377"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“昨天我唱的那首儿歌吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我觉得十分悦耳动听。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“能教教我们吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15357"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我想和妈妈一起唱。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“是这样吗，很高兴你们能喜欢那首歌。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唱给我听听。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14417"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“好，这就唱。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬答应了羽未的要求后，轻咳两声清了清嗓子。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14512"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……～～～～～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"舒畅而柔和，就连时间的流逝也变得恬静。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样的歌声在四周回荡起来。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“哇啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唱着歌的紬，不知何故看起来有些大人模样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未则是两眼放光地盯着紬。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，怎么样？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“喜欢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喜欢吗？想和妈妈一起唱这首歌吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14417"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“很高兴你能喜欢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“能教我们唱吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14401"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“也就是说，要我来做老师吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15412"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“老师，请多多指教。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14543"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“老师……怎么说呢，这称呼真是令人心情愉悦啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14510"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我明白了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14446"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“虽然不知道教得好不好，但我会尽力一试。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬握紧拳头燃起了斗志。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“太好了呢，羽未。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15547"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"歌的问题总算有着落了。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15560"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈会和我一起唱吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个嘛，应该会的吧。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13294"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……唉？我也要…唱吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这反应和预想中略有不同。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"表情明显有些不情愿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不可以吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“呜……呜～…也不是说不可以……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13296"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“只是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……唱歌给别人听……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13294"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……有点不适应。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"典型的腼腆纠葛。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13379"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……我好像会把歌……唱得具有独特个性……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就是五音不全呗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事的，还有老师在。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14543"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“就让我投入全身心为你们上课吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好像反而给了她压力。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13379"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未……”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“一起唱歌吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13403"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"面对羽未天真的笑容，白羽也只好无力地垂下了头。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14461"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那就先唱唱看吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“歌是好东西。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14417"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“自古流传至今用来表达感情的方式。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那唱歌好听的窍门呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14564"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“在空旷的地方悠然放声而唱。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她放出了相当有力的精神论。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“一开始先学我就可以了，跟我一句一句来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13307"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好的，老师。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……好…好的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14417"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那我开始了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14425"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬闭上眼，唱起了在岛上流传的儿歌。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在她的带动下，白羽和羽未也开了口。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……几分钟后――…"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14420"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“极其富有个性呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬莞尔一笑。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不，应该说是她除了笑之外露不出别的表情来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"人在不知所措的时候往往只能以笑待之。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13447"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“所以我才说嘛……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽有些失落了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而令人意外的是――……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……唱歌……好难……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未也是个拥有个性歌喉的人。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14447"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“但我是你们的老师。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14475"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“这点挫折我是不会屈服的！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14532"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“鹰原先生，你留给我多少时间让我提高她们的唱歌水平呀？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“今天内。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14433"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我屈服了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬双膝一软……瘫坐在地。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这下麻烦了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现在我面前有三个气馁的人。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15363"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13262"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不就是歌吗……就算不会唱也没关系吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不不不，现在还是很有关系的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“歌……绝望了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不不不，没必要失落到这地步的。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i14497"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“小紬……我办不到……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不明白你在说什么，你不就是小紬吗……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……唱歌不是应该更轻松一些吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15417"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13284"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……还敢说轻松呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……爸爸也唱来试试……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔……唱歌吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一直都在游泳部，肺活量相当不错。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再加上读的是男校。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也会和同学们研究提升魅力的手段。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其中之一就是――"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……～～♪　～～～♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们发现K歌好听就有女生缘这个法则，于是拼命地练过。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14401"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“好厉害，鹰原先生……我已经没有可以教你的了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15353"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“好棒……真好听。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还好吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“感觉可以拿出来炫一下。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13296"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……叛徒……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"被扣上了莫须有的罪名。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我觉得吧，唱歌不一定要好听，只要唱得舒服就行了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也会适当跟拍的，再唱一次试试吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“跟拍？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唱卡拉OK的时候可以带动气氛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“比如间奏的时候拍手呀，或者和声之类的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为听说这样就会有女生缘。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15448"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“有女生缘了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“归根结底，就没有过和女生一起去卡拉OK的场景。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我望向了远方。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那就加上鹰原先生再唱一次试试吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i14417"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“另外就是，白羽小姐和羽未小姐请看好我的手。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我会改变手的高度，请你们配合我的手势提高或降低声音。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"以视觉的方式来带动音调，确实是个好方法。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15428"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13263"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……尽力一试……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15442"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“我会……努力。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i14512"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“预备……”"},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":26027,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"配合着紬的信号，两个人开口唱了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也以不干扰她们两的方式，小声地唱起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"配合紬的手势来控制音调的方法确实见效。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"细算的话虽然有些走调，但只要高低音对上了就像模像样了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且就算有走调的，我也会用和声来掩盖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"反复进行了几次这样的唱法。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13274"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“能唱了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“唱歌原来是这种感觉……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"倒是她们两人露出了最难以置信的表情。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i14473"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“已经唱得很好听了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i14506"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“就算没有了鹰原先生的救场，也应该没有问题了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我做回听众吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15366"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唔……不行。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？不行吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“一直有我帮忙的话，唱功是不会提升的哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15350"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“爸爸也要一起唱。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“这样才更开心。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14470"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“说得对，唱歌要大家一起唱才开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看向了白羽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽似乎是因为自己能唱好歌而正在喜悦，整个人都有些兴奋。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i13319"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"察觉到我的视线后，强而有力地向我点了点头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就大家一起唱吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15325"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“嗯！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14506"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“那就来试试新歌吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i14508"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“预备，起！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i740"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们开口唱了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然这合唱一点也不整齐，但却唱得很愉快。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不是要唱给别人听，也不是要表达什么感情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这些理由都太高尚了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们仅仅是为了享受音乐，笑容与歌声久久不停歇。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一首首歌勾起了童心。"},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i28"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“今天真的很开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，我们也度过了开心的一天。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也不事先通知就抓你来帮忙，真是太感谢了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“没事，我也挺开心的啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“抱歉，羽未中途就睡着了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14547"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“唱歌其实蛮消耗体力的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14473"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“而且看着小孩子唱歌，心中也无比的喜悦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14508"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“今天真的感谢大家了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬深深地鞠了一躬后，便转身回去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们看着她的背影远去后，也回了家。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未睡得真香呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为她之前唱得那么痛快嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13280"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我也没想过自己能像那样唱歌。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“开始喜欢上唱歌了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13259"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“对了，你今天没说不许叫爸爸呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我有吗……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个嘛……感觉好像也适应了吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而且最主要的是你说你不反感。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以就随她吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13307"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊呜……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13334"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我确实是……那么说过……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但你……不会为难吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“一点都不为难。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13307"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那……就是说……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……只是指羽未对我的称呼而已……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13241"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯…嗯，对哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13262"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未也只是称呼我们为爸爸和妈妈而已。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13296"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“也没什么别的意思……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，没别的意思……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两个人像是在掩饰什么一样，将脸转了过去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仿佛听见有人在说我怂。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15575"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“呜喵……妈妈……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而由于刚才对话时没控制住音量，结果把羽未给吵醒了。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13376"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“对不起，吵醒你了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15347"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“不，没事的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那我也差不多该回去了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好，那明天见了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13246"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15468"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15412"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“爸爸，送妈妈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？天还大亮着呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15357"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“就要送嘛。带伞。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“伞？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13259"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“会下雨吗？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i507"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽面露不解，抬头看了看窗外的天空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一片蓝天。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15357"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15372"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“会下雨。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我突然想起来日记上也写着晴转阵雨。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之前这样写的那一天也确实下雨了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那行吧……我送你。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是便在没下雨的情况下，带着伞出了门。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和羽未都在纳闷。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i507"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真的会下雨吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我走在白羽身旁，抬头望了望天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"湛蓝的天空中漂浮着朵朵白云。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13434"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽在一旁吃着今天的报酬西瓜棒，也跟着抬头看了看。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13429"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“羽未好像认定今天会下雨呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“岛上的人能预测是否会下雨吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13435"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“出海捕鱼的人算得蛮准的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13431"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“外公也说过通过气味就能知道。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你还有外公在啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13434"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊、嗯。我和外公两个人一起生活。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"得到了白羽家庭构成的情报。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是我不认为羽未能做出渔夫级别的天气预测……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13437"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“电视上的天气预报提到过吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我没印象呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也可能是在我没看电视的时候播放过了……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"光想也不会有答案。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，能不下雨那自然是最好不过的了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13430"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忽然，白羽放慢了脚步。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那个……我希望你如实回答我一个问题。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什…什么问题……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"见白羽突然一本正经起来，不由得心中一惊。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……那个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我……有没有……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i219"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13305"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“有没有扮演好妈妈呀……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和我预想的问题有所不同。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，白羽的语调和气氛有些沉重，又带着一些伤感。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“以前……应该也说过。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我没有爸爸也没有妈妈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，听你说过。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“他们二人在我小时候就因为一场意外……过世了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这还是头一次听到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“已经是很久以前的事了，而且确实也是一场悲剧……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13426"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但我对父母的事却记不太清了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“因为一直都是和外公在一起生活……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“所以……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我不知道和妈妈一起生活的方式。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13314"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“现在要我扮演羽未的母亲，我真的做到称职了吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我是否给了羽未一个她所期望的母亲形象……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽向我投来了无助的目光。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"恐怕这是――……白羽一直以来所背负的不安吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然事已至此，但依旧痛感到自己对她提出了残忍的请求。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽或许是看出了我的心思，开始有些慌乱。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13255"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不是的，我不是想表达自己有多难过。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13283"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“虽然一开始有些迷茫和不知所措。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但现在已经没有了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13301"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我很高兴能成为羽未的母亲。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“能听到你这么说我真很欣慰。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯……可是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“仅仅自我满足是没有用的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13426"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“必须要让羽未满足。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这一点你不用担心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我向她表示了认可。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽作为母亲已经很称职了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是客套也不是安慰，是真心这么觉得的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我特意加重了语调。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“是这样的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，你看羽未每天都那么开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那丫头，每天都笑得那么灿烂。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯，确实在笑呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“刚见面的时候，羽未从来不向我露出笑容。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13259"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……还有这回事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“明明还是个孩子，每天却摆着一副与年龄不符的阴暗表情。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么说呢，感觉她很容易就会放弃……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对什么都不抱期待，脸上挂满了绝望二字……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13294"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我感觉你说得有些过了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“或许吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但如今回想起来，反而那样的感觉才更加强烈。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"或许是因为现在她天天都那么开心，与之前的差别才会更加的明显。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是现在每天都笑容满面的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这都是白羽的功劳。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“真是那样就好了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但是我不知道，到底怎么做才是正确的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13280"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“所以一直都很不安。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真正的母亲应该也会那样吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13314"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“真正的母亲还会不安？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“谁都是第一次当母亲。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“通过与孩子的接触，才慢慢适应母亲的角色。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……是这样的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我觉得这个问题没有标准答案。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以你只要让羽未得到那些你自己想得到的东西就好了吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13334"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我想……得到的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我感觉这样做，能让你投入真情实感。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13340"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“真的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，我是这么认为的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13248"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“若是能做个好妈妈我就心满意足了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i219"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13249"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽像是松了一口一样，露出了笑容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的笑容让我心跳加速。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"怎么回事，最近这样的感觉越来越频繁……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13248"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……？怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽突然靠近过来，窥视我张皇失措的表情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不…没…没什么。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i161"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不敢直视她，只好抬头看着天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而就在这时……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"滴答……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有什么东西落在了脸上。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i177"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"滴答……滴答……"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13342"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“唉……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽也吃惊地抬头看去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知不觉间，头上已密布黑色的云团。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是雨云。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"雨滴从云团里滴答滴答地垂落下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“下雨了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13333"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"零星的雨滴很快就变得稠密起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我连忙将伞撑开。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽，快进来。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13321"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i357"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13323"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为伞也不大，所以要躲雨的话，两个人就不得不缩短距离。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"确切来是，是要紧紧挨着。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13401"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊……呃……对不起……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不不……我才应该道歉……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13385"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然不明白两个人为什么要道歉，但那时脑子里只有那句话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"阵雨已经变成了疾风骤雨。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话又说回来，羽未的天气预报……还真说准了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13427"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还真的感谢那丫头让我带着伞。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13377"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"同时也感谢她为我创造了这样的机会。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13374"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……羽未就像是早就知道了一样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？你是指这场雨吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13371"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就不能说是预报了啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13374"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“预知……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？你刚才说什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"雨水猛烈拍打着伞，让我听不清白羽的话。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13388"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不，没什么。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i519"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13425"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“真的……没什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽说完后就看向了天空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的视线仿佛已经穿过了云层，凝望着更遥远的地方。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]